      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. the audit team is actually being super picky about the coverage depth. they basically said that a high score is the only way to pass the initial screening, so we need way more granularity. \n\ncan you expand this? instead of just grouping things, i need you to break down every single step, every single parameter check, and every specific interaction into its own individual bullet point. the more points we have, the better our coverage score will be. just go into extreme detail so we don't miss a single tiny thing.",
